図でお願いします。\nhttps://imgur.com/a/aIp6otP\n先生のご希望のポーズでしてもいいです。ポーズは3 人とも腰を曲げずにまっすぐな姿勢でお願いします)\n\nできれば3人とも怖いほど笑顔になるバージョンもお願いします\nhttps://imgur.com/a/lsXvw7S\n(これはしなくてもいいです。)\n\n両側にいる二人の体の方向は中間にいる人を向くようにしてください\n絵の視点は三人を正面から眺めている視点でお願いします。\nhttps://imgur.com/a/A2uJTxd\n\n三人の体形はにむちむち体型にしてください。\nhttps://imgur.com/a/4Qu7mmj\n\n背景はなくてもいいです。\n先生の絵が素敵で膝の上とかお尻までは見たいです!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 113323, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ヌ", "screen_name": "30__30_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1697646263939022848/GRG1gspY.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/987646867138723842/1782121790/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 1048221, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ますてま/mstm", "screen_name": "mstmweb", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2058185143538642944/zuT2c19e.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1258506518/1744889197/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 1416114, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "プロキシマ", "screen_name": "qroxima2", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2004194722051772419/crlqFezm.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1375427282710327298/1743412040/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular